@startuml
title Use Case 5: Create Profile
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantStyle rectangle
skinparam Shadowing false

actor User
participant "FrontEnd" as App
participant "Users" as Users
database "MongoDB" as DB

App -> App : Check onboardingCompletedAt
App --> User : Show Create Profile page with location, transportation, budget, and interest controls
User -> App : Enter starting location
User -> App : Select transportation, budget, and interest preferences
alt starting location is missing or exceeds supported length
    App --> User : Disable Create profile and identify field
else valid profile input
    User -> App : Select Create profile
    App -> Users : updateUser(userId: string, update: UserUpdate): Promise<User>
    Users -> DB : findOneAndUpdate({ _id: objectId }, { $set: fields }, { returnDocument: 'after' })
    note right of DB : Complete profile sets onboardingCompletedAt.
    alt profile saved
        DB --> Users : User
        Users --> App : User
        App --> User : Open main application
    else server or network error
        DB --> Users : error
        Users --> App : error
        App --> User : Keep entered values, show error, and allow retry
    end
end
@enduml
